1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,002
One more note.

2
00:00:01,002 --> 00:00:12,018
With ammonia, the amine formed is itself a nucleophile, so it keeps reacting, giving secondary and tertiary amines and finally a quaternary ammonium salt.

3
00:00:12,018 --> 00:00:16,653
A large excess of ammonia keeps the product mostly primary.

